    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds pretty heavy. but wouldn't some people argue that these companies are just winning because they're better at what they do? like, if they provide better services and lower prices, does it really matter if they're huge? isn't there a risk that breaking them up would just kill the innovation that made them great in the first place?",
